      "area": "Unit cells & crystals",
      "named": "UiO-68 unit cell, ball and stick",
      "source": "assistant",
      "description": "UiO-68 (Zr terphenyldicarboxylate MOF) conventional cubic unit cell, a = 3.29 nm, 920 atoms, in nanometres. Ball-and-stick style without polyhedra or cell box: Zr grey-blue, O red, C grey, H white. Built geometrically from the UiO-66 cluster with longer linkers (rings coplanar), not refined from a CIF. Companion of the polyhedral UiO-68 cell.",
      "tags": [
       "MOF",
       "UiO-68",
       "zirconium",
       "ball and stick",
       "crystal"
      ]
     }
